    <a href="https://depistage-cancers-idf.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" alt="Lien vers le site officiel du CRCDC Essonne"><img src="/assets/img/logo/crcdc.webp" class="proposed-by" alt="Logo du CRCDC"></a>
